Don't forget to
  - add "gl/lib/Makefile" to AC_CONFIG_FILES in ./configure.ac,
  - add "gl/ref-po/Makefile.in" to AC_CONFIG_FILES in ./configure.ac,
  - mention "lib" in SUBDIRS in gl/Makefile.am,
  - mention "ref-po" in SUBDIRS in gl/Makefile.am,
  - mention "-I gl/m4" in ACLOCAL_AMFLAGS in Makefile.am
    or add an AC_CONFIG_MACRO_DIRS([gl/m4]) invocation in ./configure.ac,
  - mention "gl/m4/gnulib-cache.m4" in EXTRA_DIST in Makefile.am,
  - invoke gl_EARLY in ./configure.ac, right after AC_PROG_CC,
  - invoke gl_INIT in ./configure.ac.
